              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" sha256=\"8d4bfe33c489d7d62e0d53c9b07aa96d2b6bbe2c70b03fb8a06dc14c89bd2d59\" kind=\"text\" label=\"scope evidence\">\nSeller: Kivuli Sandal Studio, Kenya\nBuyer: Nara Vale\nOrder date: 4 March 2025\nPayment method: PayPal\nCurrency: USD\n\nAgreed goods and packing requirements:\n- Supply two pairs of brown leather sandals in EU size 40.\n- Include two cotton drawstring storage bags.\n- Stamp the buyer's initials NV on each sandal footbed.\n- Include four spare leather ankle straps.\n\nGoods: USD 96\nPacking and shipping: USD 14\nTotal: USD 110\n\nThe buyer approved these requirements before payment. The sandals and accessories are to be packed together in one parcel for delivery to the buyer.\n</evidence>"
